er News\r\nReceive quick updates on breaking weather news in 60 words & one-minute videos. We\u2019ll send you interesting shorts, weather tips, articles, insights & videos on topics relevant to you. We are also always ready with seasonal tips for extreme weather that are useful and help you stay worry-free.\r\n\r\nCustomizable Alerts\r\nWe want you to always stay in the know! Receive the latest weather alerts and warnings issued for your city by the National Weather Service (NWS), NOAA, Storm Prediction Center, Dark Sky & WDT. 1Weather's immediate notification of real-time weather changes is designed to help you & your loved ones stay safe.\r\n\r\nBeautiful Weather Widgets\r\nAt 1Weather, we want you to see the weather your way. You can track weather from your home screens with customizable home screen widgets. Choose from 1x1 widget, 2x1, 2x2, 2x3, 3x4, 4x1 widget, 4x2, 4x3, 5x1 widget, & 5x2 widget sizes in preferred formats like large clock widget, time widget, forecast widget.\r\n\r\nSun and Moon Tracker\r\nWhether you're a stargazer, photographer, or simply curious about the skies, this tool is your go-to companion. Plan your day or night activities with sunrise, sunset, moonrise, and moonset. Explore various moon phases, including New Moon and Full Moon.\r\n\r\nAdditional features\r\nCustomizable Units: Personalize your weather experience by customizing units to your preference.\r\nMultilingual Support: Choose from multiple languages to make the app more accessible to you.\r\nDark and Light Themes: Customize your app's appearance with dark and light themes to suit your preferences and reduce eye strain in low-light conditions.\r\n\r\nDownload the best android weather app for accurate weather updates, wherever you go!\r\n\r\nFor any queries, feel free to reach us at oneweather@onelouder.com.\r\n\r\nNote: We may collect information from your use of the app that we may share with our partners to deliver personalized ads and improve our services. You may modify y